DA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49725809?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal","html_url":"https://github.com/selimsandal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selimsandal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":474,"digest":"sha256:d1cc714711d7b1d2b5eaa05f515e2b20552d64467c1799021154a85b63714e57","download_count":425,"created_at":"2026-11-14T23:29:35Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:29:35Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/apex-compute/ANR/releases/download/FG-V.B18/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apex-compute/ANR/tarball/FG-V.B18","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apex-compute/ANR/zipball/FG-V.B18","body":"# ANR FG Beta, FG V.B18\n\n## Changes\n\n- Fix for games with a 24-bit depth buffer on AMD GPUs on Windows, where ANR FG turned itself off (#43).\n- Same model weights as V.B16.\n\n## Packages\n\n- `anr-fg-V.B18-full.zip`: for games without OptiScaler.\n- `anr-fg-V.B18-addon.zip`: for games that already use [OptiScaler](https://github.com/optiscaler/OptiScaler).\n- `anr-fg-V.B18-kit-windows.zip`, `anr-fg-V.B18-kit-linux.tar.gz`: test kits (`TESTERS.md` inside; the same as V.B17's). The macOS kit stays V.B15's.\n- `anr-fg-V.B18-full-optiscaler-source.zip`: OptiScaler's source (GPL-3.0).\n- `nr-record-1.2-windows.zip`, `nr-record-1.2-linux.tar.gz`: [nr-record](https://github.com/apex-compute/ANR#record-and-compare-frame-generation) 1.2 (checksums in `nr-record-1.2-SHA256SUMS.txt`). New: nr-replay corrects recordings whose HUD-less color is a real frame late, so ANR FG replays are no longer a real frame behind; the Windows programs and capture DLLs are signed.\n\n## Install\n\n1. Close the game, extract the package and run the installer with the folder of the game's `.exe`:\n   - Windows: `install.cmd` (needs the Microsoft Visual C++ 2015-2022 Redistributable, x64)\n   - Linux and Steam Deck (Proton): `sh install.sh \"<folder>\"`, then set the game's launch options to the line it prints (`WINEDLLOVERRIDES=\"dxgi=n,b\" %command%`, or `winmm=n,b` in Vulkan games)\n2. In the game, turn on frame generation (the NVIDIA option where the game offers several).\n\nTo uninstall, run `uninstall.cmd` or `sh uninstall.sh` with the same folder.\n\n## Supported GPUs\n\nNVIDIA GeForce RTX 20 and newer, GTX 16; AMD Radeon RX 5000 and newer, Steam Deck; Intel Arc A and B. Windows 10 and 11, Linux and SteamOS with Proton.\n\n## Feedback\n\nPost performance results (the test kit's result file) and problems as [issues](https://github.com/apex-compute/ANR/issues/new/choose), with the newest `nr_fg-*.log` from the game's `OptiScaler/custom/Apex Neural Rendering FG` folder.\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apex-compute/ANR/releases/445636940/reactions","total_count":25,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":9,"rocket":8,"eyes":0}}